      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここが魔道図書館。\r\n何千年前からの本が眠る場所じゃ……。",
        "official_en": "’Tis the Arcane Library, where books from across the ages are stored.",
        "real_en": "This is the Arcane Library, where books thousands of years old are kept..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
