        "official_en_sha256": "c1aca8ba9397e5faf5b45ea5e45921e4a6075a8095c14cafc1e1444fa40e81d7"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そんなことより\r\nフィーナを助けたいのじゃろ？\r\nならばここで一冊の魔道書を探すのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "That is hardly of import at the moment. We are here to save Fina—and for that, we must fetch a particular magic tome.",
        "real_en": "More importantly, you want to save Fina, right? Then you need to find a particular spellbook here."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
