        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_514_01:514_01_017:a07c473b",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_514_01:514_01_017:a07c473b",
        "jp_sha256": "d0aa5883b4b6ef51b6345f6c6bf1093e11845b4578e687d44219042ecc075b3f",
        "official_en_sha256": "29e727c33aa9412b3f8424c1f2fa633613a8e8cd964b1aa3097f8e5db3398d9b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はい。\r\n本棚から魔物が棲みついている本を見つけてください。",
        "official_en": "Yes, I’m afraid so. Please, find the books haunted by monsters and put an end to their nonsense.",
        "real_en": "Yes. Find the books the monsters have taken up residence in."
      },
      "review": {
